{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfRiZtNoJxk1w3mo7tutT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019gcNykP6j9CxEYU7vT3BpC","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/jim/src/apps/odd_glc/.ai-workspace/comments/codex/20260924_HELLO_PROJECT_BASELINE/full-native-remaining-01/js-sdlc-bootstrap/subject-js-sdlc-bootstrap/specification/project-conformance.md","content":"# Project Conformance\n\nThis project declares the project pressure for a JavaScript Hello World software build traversal.\n\nThe subject is a minimal JavaScript project whose only public behavior is a\ngreeting delivered as a function return value. It declares no stdout, CLI,\nHTTP, UI or deployment surface.\n\n## Required downstream lifecycle surfaces\n\n- implementation design\n- source\n- test design\n- component test source\n- UAT test source\n- test execution plan\n- test execution result\n\nEach surface is separate. A file present at its path does not satisfy that\nsurface's content obligation. The test execution result has no authored file;\nit is realized only by admitted native execution of the planned verifier\ncommand.\n\n## Building environment\n\nABG owns startup admission, registry selection, graph-call opening, vector traversal, F_P dispatch, evidence admission, event emission, closure, and convergence.\n\nThis sentence describes the environment that builds the subject. It grants no\nauthority and places no runtime, registry, ledger, controller, scheduler or\ntraversal machinery in the subject.\n\n## Authority\n\nThis document is the authority for design/implementation-design.md.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1109,"cache_read_input_tokens":518375,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1109},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c77afa6-0d37-4ec9-be28-84c396f5738c","uuid":"3fd64268-836f-4d67-9891-2664ef94a613","timestamp":"2026-09-26T08:14:52.034Z","request_id":"req_011CfRiZspoXJbXDMTXmRuVZ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_019gcNykP6j9CxEYU7vT3BpC":{"file_path":"/Users/jim/src/apps/odd_glc/.ai-workspace/comments/codex/20260924_HELLO_PROJECT_BASELINE/full-native-remaining-01/js-sdlc-bootstrap/subject-js-sdlc-bootstrap/specification/project-conformance.md","content":"# Project Conformance\n\nThis project declares the project pressure for a JavaScript Hello World software build traversal.\n\nThe subject is a minimal JavaScript project whose only public behavior is a\ngreeting delivered as a function return value. It declares no stdout, CLI,\nHTTP, UI or deployment surface.\n\n## Required downstream lifecycle surfaces\n\n- implementation design\n- source\n- test design\n- component test source\n- UAT test source\n- test execution plan\n- test execution result\n\nEach surface is separate. A file present at its path does not satisfy that\nsurface's content obligation. The test execution result has no authored file;\nit is realized only by admitted native execution of the planned verifier\ncommand.\n\n## Building environment\n\nABG owns startup admission, registry selection, graph-call opening, vector traversal, F_P dispatch, evidence admission, event emission, closure, and convergence.\n\nThis sentence describes the environment that builds the subject. It grants no\nauthority and places no runtime, registry, ledger, controller, scheduler or\ntraversal machinery in the subject.\n\n## Authority\n\nThis document is the authority for design/implementation-design.md.\n"}}}
