{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfRiZtNoJxk1w3mo7tutT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013Q2T3cLKXo8dszwyKnGBsz","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/jim/src/apps/odd_glc/.ai-workspace/comments/codex/20260924_HELLO_PROJECT_BASELINE/full-native-remaining-01/js-sdlc-bootstrap/subject-js-sdlc-bootstrap/design/implementation-design.md","content":"# Implementation Design\n\nAuthority: specification/project-conformance.md\n\nThis design derives from the project pressure and downstream lifecycle\nsurfaces declared in specification/project-conformance.md.\n\n## Minimal module\n\nsrc/hello.mjs is an ES module that exports a named, synchronous function\nhelloWorld(). Called with no arguments, it returns exactly \"Hello, world!\" as\nits direct value. It has no imports, no default export and no output.\n\n## Package\n\npackage.json declares exactly \"private\": true and \"type\": \"module\". It\ndeclares no other field, so it adds no bin, script or other output surface.\n\n## Separate lifecycle surfaces\n\n- package.json\n- src/hello.mjs\n- design/test-design.md\n- test/component/hello.test.mjs\n- test/uat/hello.uat.test.mjs\n- test-execution-plan.json\n- execution result\n\nThe execution result has no file. It is realized only by admitted native\nexecution of the planned command recorded in test-execution-plan.json.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1109,"cache_read_input_tokens":518375,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1109},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c77afa6-0d37-4ec9-be28-84c396f5738c","uuid":"73412958-8915-4cf5-9824-4f5d401d4db9","timestamp":"2026-09-